<mxCell id="footer" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend:&lt;/b&gt; solid blue = synchronous request path · dashed blue = asynchronous event/batch flow · dotted orange = write to storage tier · green = training/registry flow · purple = CI/CD control · dashed red = alert/automated response&lt;br&gt;Connectors:  A = GitHub deploy &amp;amp; traffic split → endpoint   ·   B = func-fraud-ops repository_dispatch (drift-retrain, promotion hold) → GitHub   ·   C = hourly feature materialization → Redis&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Targets: peak 100K txn/h (27.8 tps), Black Friday 3.5× (97 tps) · p99 ≤ 120 ms · 99.9% availability · auto-rollback &amp;lt; 5 min · drift alert ≤ 2 h (requirement &amp;lt; 4 h) · predictions + features kept 7 y · CI/CD logs 2 y&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#F3F2F1;strokeColor=#D2D0CE;rounded=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="10" y="910" width="1382" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
